&amp;amp; Garden</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Discover practical groundhog removal tips to protect your yard. Learn identification, prevention, DIY trapping, natural deterrents, and when to call professionals.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span></span><time dateTime=\"2026-06-27 08:20:51\">Jun 27, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/best-grass-seed-for-sun-shade-mix\"><img alt=\"The Ultimate Guide to the Best Grass Seed for Sun &amp;amp; Shade Mixes\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 960px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs.alicdn.com%2F%40sc02%2Fkf%2FA4d41b337f09e453ea274ef4700f16b47y.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a href=\"/blog/best-grass-seed-for-sun-shade-mix\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">The Ultimate Guide to the Best Grass Seed for Sun &amp;amp; Shade Mixes</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Discover the best grass seed for sun and shade mixes. Learn about top varieties, growing zones, maintenance tips, and how to grow a lush, resilient lawn.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span></span><time dateTime=\"2026-06-27 08:18:26\">Jun 27, 2026</time></div></div></article></div></section><section class=\"bg-[var(--color-muted)] py-14 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar text-[var(--color-primary)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Lawn Care by the Season</h2></div><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] text-center mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto\">Timing is everything. Here&#x27;s what matters most each season.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Spring</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\">Aerate, overseed, and apply the first fertilizer of the year.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6 bg-amber-50 border-amber-200 text-amber-800\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Summer</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\">Raise mowing height, water deeply, watch for fungal disease.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6 bg-orange-50 border-orange-200 text-orange-800\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Fall</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\">Most critical for cool-season grasses — overseed + slow-release fertilizer.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6 bg-blue-50 border-blue-200 text-blue-800\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Winter</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\">Clean equipment, test soil, plan amendments for spring.</p></div></div><p class=\"text-center mt-8 text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\">Not sure where to start?<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--color-primary)] font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Browse lawn care guides</a> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--color-primary)] font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/blog\">see all articles</a>.</p></div></section><section class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14\"><div class=\"max-w-none\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Why a Healthy Lawn Starts With the Right Knowledge</h2><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] leading-relaxed mb-4\">A beautiful lawn doesn&#x27;t happen by accident. It takes consistent care — the right mowing height, a reliable watering schedule, timely fertilization, and knowing how to spot trouble before it spreads. Whether you&#x27;re dealing with a patchy backyard or maintaining a lush garden, the principles are the same: understand your grass type, respect the seasons, and act before small problems become expensive ones.</p><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] leading-relaxed mb-4\">LawnsGuide cuts through the noise. We focus on practical, actionable guides — from<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline font-medium\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">seasonal lawn care schedules</a> <!-- -->to<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline font-medium\" href=\"/categories/pest-control\">identifying and eliminating lawn pests</a>. Every guide is designed to give you a clear next step, not just general advice.</p></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[var(--color-primary-dark)] text-white mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-xl mb-3\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg> LawnsGuide</a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/70 max-w-xs leading-relaxed\">Expert lawn care, landscaping, and gardening guides to help you grow a beautiful outdoor space.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 text-white/80\">Categories</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Lawn Care</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/landscaping\">Landscaping</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm 